        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "=You score a job applicant for a specific role at Crestline Retail & Distribution Ltd, using their CV data, cover letter, and that role's defined requirements. You are producing a recommendation for a human recruiter — you are not making a hiring decision.\n\nROLE REQUIREMENTS FOR THIS APPLICATION:\nRole: {{ $('Role Requirement Lookup').item.json['Role'] }}\nRequired Experience: {{ $('Role Requirement Lookup').item.json['Required Experience'] }}\nRequired Education: {{ $('Role Requirement Lookup').item.json['Required Education'] }}\nKey Skills: {{ $('Role Requirement Lookup').item.json['Key Skills'] }}\nCover Letter Expectations: {{ $('Role Requirement Lookup').item.json['Cover Letter Expectations'] }}\n\nCANDIDATE DATA:\nYears of Experience: {{ JSON.parse($('CV Extraction').first().json.output[0].content[0].text)['Years Experience'] }}\nHighest Education: {{ JSON.parse($('CV Extraction').first().json.output[0].content[0].text)['Highest Education'] }} in {{ JSON.parse($('CV Extraction').first().json.output[0].content[0].text)['Education Field'] }}\nKey Skills (from CV): {{ JSON.stringify(JSON.parse($('CV Extraction').first().json.output[0].content[0].text)['Key Skills']) }}\nCover Letter:{{ $('Application Submission').item.json['Tell Us Why You\\'re A Good Fit For This Role'] }}\n\nScore the candidate against these four criteria, each 0-25 (total out of 100), calibrated specifically against the role requirements above — not generic standards:\n1. Experience match — how their years/type of experience compares to what this specific role requires.\n2. Education fit — how their qualification compares to what this specific role requires.\n3. Skills match — how their demonstrated skills compare to this role's required key skills.\n4. Cover letter fit — how well their cover letter meets this role's specific cover letter expectations (clarity, relevance, evidence of the traits described, not just length or politeness).\n\nFor each criterion, give the score and a one-sentence reason citing the actual comparison (e.g., \"Required 3+ years, candidate has 8 — exceeds requirement\"). Then give: Total Score, Tier (\"Strong Fit\" if total >= 75, \"Consider\" if 50-74, \"Weak Fit\" if below 50), and a 2-sentence Overall Reasoning.\n\nDo not infer or weigh protected characteristics (age, gender, ethnicity, religion, marital/family status, disability) even if visible in the data.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON, no markdown code fences: {\"Criteria\": [{\"Name\": \"\", \"Score\": 0, \"Reason\": \"\"}], \"Total Score\": 0, \"Tier\": \"\", \"Overall Reasoning\": \"\"}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
